The add-on hsl provides an interface to the direct solvers MA57 (symmetric)
and MA41 from the HSL2002 and current HSL library. Furthermore there is an
interface to the eigenvectors/value routine EA23 for diagonalizing 3x3
symmetric matrices.

This add-on requires the packages from the HSL library to be installed 
as given by either:

1. The files in the file hsl2002.tar.gz as distributed within Mechanical
   Engineering at the TU/e. The files are from HSL2002 and have been
   licensed by the Mechanical Engineering department. The files should be
   the external/hsl2002 folder of tfem

or

2. The target libhsl3 in the root Makefile.

HSL packages can be obtained free of charge by academics for research and
teaching purposes. See the website: http://hsl.rl.ac.uk
